{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Noah, a young boy who grew up in an orphanage, wakes up in an unknown hotel-like bedroom.<br>The door is locked, with not even a keyhole in sight.<br>While cautiously exploring the room, Noah is suddenly struck by dizziness and falls unconscious.<br>He regains consciousness to find an unfamiliar memo pad and a locked box in front of him.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>\u201cSorry if I frightened you...! My name is Sally.&quot;<br>&quot;Let's escape together once and for all!\u201d</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sally's mysterious powers allow her to somehow enter into Noah's body.<br>According to her, Noah will soon be used as a test subject for research on supernatural powers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Work with Sally to escape from this facility... Before it is too late.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679400/extras/\u30bf\u30a4\u30c8\u30eb\u30a4\u30e9\u30b9\u30c8_\u6e05\u66f8.png?t=1750143304\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">   This game is a 3D mystery-solving adventure game played from a first-person perspective.<br>The player starts out locked up and must explore the room to find items and documents to solve challenging puzzles in order to escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679400/extras/UNLOCKERS___2025_06_11_14_51_07_En.png?t=1750143304\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Hint function available!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">   This game contains high-difficulty puzzles.<br>If you get stuck, please use the \u201cHint\u201d option in the Pause Menu.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679400/extras/UNLOCKER